    "b-20-pr-review-the-pr-splitter-is-the-i-16": {
      "id": "b-20-pr-review-the-pr-splitter-is-the-i-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The PR splitter is the intelligent planning layer between end-of-run handoff\nand PR review. "
        },
        {
          "insert": "pr-split-plan",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " still collects deterministic facts: changed\nfiles, checkpoint lanes, ship-status filtering, base/head refs, size limits,\nseed slices, and validation commands. With "
        },
        {
          "insert": "--strategy agent",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " or project\n"
        },
        {
          "insert": "pr.splitStrategy: \"agent\"",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", that deterministic plan becomes the splitter\ncontext."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-20-pr-review-the-splitter-returns-me-17": {
      "id": "b-20-pr-review-the-splitter-returns-me-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The splitter returns "
        },
        {
          "insert": "melee_pr_splitter_plan_v1",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ": ordered slices with\nsanitized ids, display names, titles, lanes, scopes, exact file lists,\ndependencies, independence hypotheses, review focus, PR-body summaries, risks,\nvalidation notes, warnings, rationale, and confidence. The server job validates the\nproposal before use: every changed file must appear exactly once, files must\nstay in their deterministic lanes, lanes cannot mix inside one slice,\ndependencies must point to emitted slice ids, and the max-files-per-PR ceiling\nmust hold. Invalid or unparseable output keeps the deterministic plan and adds\na warning plus splitter artifacts for inspection."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-20-pr-review-splitter-prompt-artifact-18": {
      "id": "b-20-pr-review-splitter-prompt-artifact-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Splitter prompt artifacts are written under the command's agent output\ndirectory. The dashboard passes the run id to "
        },
        {
          "insert": "pr-split-plan",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", so live splitter\nsessions are recorded as "
        },
        {
          "insert": "pr-splitter",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " Pi sessions and appear in the run\ndetails rail."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-20-pr-review-pre-ship-review-mode-19": {
      "id": "b-20-pr-review-pre-ship-review-mode-19",
